<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Bella</book>
  <para style="h">2 Bitrus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bitrusiib ujawaab umalya</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Bitrus</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bitrusiib ujawaab umalya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Siimoon Bitrus, Yasuuꞌa Umasiihiib ukishiyaawwa ulinguumaawwa ikatiinaay, baliib Ukwaasanaayoonwa Wꞌishidhhiin Yasuuꞌaab Umasiihiit shibootii wꞌiimaan wꞌalyaab oon hineet attiyeewiyaab bareeh ookiik:<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Ukwaasanaayt kanaantiiwwa Yasuuꞌaab Wꞌankwanaayiisoon geebiiwwa gwidaat nꞌimaawwa mꞌasigwa imeer akeena.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wꞌankwanaay yꞌaamananaayeet ookwiraay</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Hinin Ukwaasana harriiweeb umidhhan nikweeree dehaay naatka nibari. Naatka aree Ukwaasana ooknaay akriree nittiyeewaay. Baruuh tudaayiinaaytooh tꞌajjabsitniit adhuudhiib waliikaayoon ikatiyeet toona nikan. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Een bareesooh geebii Ukwaasana winneet tageegaawwa alya waadiyaayoohwa yhii hoon, aflaay een bareeyooh geebii Wꞌankwanaayt tehayꞌaatiyooh shaaraknay aree tishahwa toon tuduniyaatiib tikwasiyeeb ufasaadii eedhhaniin nikati.<verse eid="2PE 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Toon toonaati sabbii, wꞌiimaanookna daayiinaayt hooy teeshiwiineet toona winneet jarrabaana. Aree tudaayiinaay kanaant hooy shaawna, <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />aree tukanaan garooy-kaleewtiib hooy shaawna, aree ugarooy-kaleewtiib tarmuumaab shaawna, aree utarmuumaay Ukwaasanaay mirkwaay shaawna, <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />aree Ukwaasanaay mirkwaayiib isanaayeet areesamtiib hooy shaawna, aree isanaayeet wꞌareesamtiib reer shaawna. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Een yꞌawsafeeb gwidaana ameeshiwiyaab tikatiyeek, baraah Wꞌankwanaayoon Yasuuꞌaab Umasiihiit tukanaantiyookna nafꞌaatwa samaraatwa ibariin ikwasiin hookna. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Laakiin gaal han bareeh biibariyeek, baruuh dawilna rhiniibwa hamashaywa ikati, aree baruuh idanuubeeh ishꞌiiyaayee inhaseet toona baadhinaab ikati.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Shaawti Yꞌarawaan, Ukwaasana sidik bareek waliikiyaayt waasaayookna ikatiyeet toona ibakii winneet rhisaana. Teen teena tidꞌaneek, door han dhibi kitdiina, <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />aree Wꞌankwanaayoonwa Wꞌishidhhiinwa Yasuuꞌaab Umasiihiit tehadꞌaayi tudaayimti shuumtiib daayi ashuush imaar tiyadna.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ooktaabi siruud</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Baraak oosdik attiyeewiyaab tikatiineeb daayiib abkaabaana. Laakiin ani masi teen teena shꞌasani hookna. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Ani masi dhhaniib akatiyihoob ibakii teen teena bareek shꞌasaniyeet toona ankwiin. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Wꞌankwanaayuun Yasuuꞌa Umasiih han suur akay willa oon ugaru iiyꞌish andiyeet toona sooyiheeb. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Aree oon usabbii ani ayaayihoob beet toona kastooh shꞌiteeni jillaay oontꞌa daayiib sooyani hookna.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Hinin Wꞌankwanaayoon Yasuuꞌa Umasiihiib yꞌakrirwa timꞌageerwa bareekna soonanihoob, gwadi kwaasaab iiktiini mitaal dehookna hadiidaab kinki. Laakiin umatuunooh usidkiib hinin iknaayaan igwꞌadeesoon rhina. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Ukwaasana Ubaaba hamooyseewwa matuunwa barooh yhiiyyihoob, hinin beentooy niifi. Whiss Tageega Matuunii bariiyooh dehaay eeyaayt, “Uun baruuh wꞌooru ani areeyaniyeebu, ani bariiyooh geeb winneet afirhaabu!” idi. <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Oon whiss tibreetee nꞌati yꞌee hinin iknaayaan nimaasiw. Hinin been oodoor bariiyooh geeb oorba umugaddasi kehii niifi.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Aree tuun batuuh kastuuh inabiya diyaab iiktiineet toona winneet sidik tikwasi. Aflaay bareetooh tudiigwat daayiib sinaakirna, tuun batuuh thibnama haashiib teekiruum ookiikwa oomhi hayuukw iginꞌaayeeb talawiiniib ookiikwa balooltiniit tulamba tꞌiiteeti. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Laakiin gaal han oodꞌooh eektabi tafsiir tari siruud biiꞌafhamayeet toona ibakii kanna. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Inabiya aakna teen teena kwinaab kiikeena, laakiin baraah Eeshuuk Imugaddasaayee mitiyaamaaba.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Gwisri nabiyaawwa koojaawwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Door gaal gwisri nabiya Israaꞌiileeb oodehay bhaliisamiyaan. Masi gwisri nabiya bareek han geebookna laweetiit gwisir infirid hookna iyadna. Laakiin aan ikooja, bareeyooh jillaay alya taman kwisiyaab Wꞌankwanaay sidik kiikeen. Baraah willa igarooyeehna kwidhsi iyadna. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Gwida dehay bareetooh tumaagti salala saki iyadna, weer dehay han usidki salaliib gwisir hadiidsi iyadna. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Baraah ikooja haamaaba aree baraah aakna kwaasaab ikatiini gwisri mitaalee mhallagaab hookna iyayna. Laakiin shꞌiika Ukwaasana bareeh jasaab dehaay niyaamiya, aree Ukwaasana kadiwiya.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Ukwaasana toomaag idꞌiin imalakee dehaay nꞌakwmanaayaab kiiki. Laakiin bareeh whukwimiit tooyin ookiik yhaakwiraayt thibnama deelaay nꞌeetiib igid. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Aree Noohiib udamaaniib, Ukwaasana tuduniyaati dehay yꞌaamanaab baakaynee dehaay nꞌakwmanaayaab kiiki. Baruuh bareeh kwaanii kwidhisiya, asimhay nafara Nooh hooy iifiyeeb, oosdik bhaliiyiin baliib, ishidhhan. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Ukwaasana timadiina Sadoomwa Gamooraawwa iliw idꞌiit nꞌeetihaash ikwaasiit jasaaya. Aree oodehay yꞌaamanaab baakay naan dehaay iikti tindiyeeb bateeh misaal dehaay ikwaas. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Luut ushibu tak, yꞌamag da sakiineet toonaatiib winneet gadabaa iifi akay, Ukwaasana barooh ishidhhan. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Been ushibu tak bareeyooh geeb ikwiir, baruuh bꞌeebka baraah sakiineet tumaagti shaga iimsaw aree rhiyeebka winneet lhami. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Tuun tuuna Wꞌankwana oodehay eeshboob kak igwirhaayee ishidhhiiniyeet toona rhistini. Aree oodehay yꞌamag whukwimiit tuyintiib kak jasaayiiniyeet toona rhistini. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Wꞌankwana barooh baasinaakiir iknaayeet tumaagtiit niyaatoohna nuun weena baakwiin oodehayi geeb ankiir.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Baraah takweet kiibariina aree kibir ibariina aree umatuuni kinaayi kehii amaagna whadiidti kiirikwiin. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Laakiin imalak toon tumaagtikinaayeeka taad ibariinkaabwa akrakaabwa ikatiineek han, bareeh Wꞌankwanaay suurii kaꞌatehimiyaan. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Laakiin aan aanda biikaanneet halaagayteeb ikafirna. Baraah tidhhaniya tisoosaari wꞌagil baabari, uudehay shookiit ideerni jillaay farayt tꞌiiteeba, aree baraah han tidhhaniyaateet kwidhi iyadna.<verse eid="2PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Baraah maagnaayt idꞌiina, aree maagnaayt itkwis iyadna.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:13">Baraah kassooh oombꞌi nafirnayteeb daayeeneet toona firhaat hiiseen. Baraah najjasamaabwa eebamaabwa ikatiin. Tinajasaatee rayhameena aree talasaab jarrabeen hookna, aree tꞌaduumaateeb geebookna shaarakeen. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Igwꞌadaahna jikuun ataba, baraah tumaagti dꞌuuyii door han kiisingadna. Oodehay eenꞌakw sharakiib dhibseen. Iginꞌaayaahna haamtiib ataba. Baraah atooꞌita firaay ikatiin. <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Baraah usalal udaayiib ingadna idꞌiiniit, unabi Balꞌaam Baaꞌoori oor, tumaagti shagaay imiireeb ukiraayi mhallaga areeyaab, barooh misaal ikwaasniit halaag salal sakiyaan. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Laakiin barooh tumaagti dꞌuuyooh dehaay imeednaan, meekii imeednaan. Uumeek ubaahadiiday aadami hissii unabi bhaliisamiyaayt bariiyooh whaalaleeti isingad.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Aan baraah reet balamaat tꞌiiteeba, ibꞌaluuk baraam nanfiyeeb tꞌiiteeba. Bareeh nꞌeet thibnamaat hangiit. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Baraah yꞌafreeyeehna haay eefishna, dꞌam baabari bhali hadiideena aree oodehay maagnaaytiib dhibsitiib sooyeena aree baliib wꞌamaag salalii ikweer oodehayii ifooriin sharakiib dhibseen. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Baraah oodehay fadagooyt waadiyaayeena, laakiin uudehay bareeh kaleewtiniit toonaati kishiya ikatiinayt, baraah aakna idanuubwa fasaadi kishiyaawwa ikatiin. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Baraah Wꞌankwanaayoonwa Wꞌishidhhiinwa Yasuuꞌa Umasiih ikannihoob, teen tuduniyaatiit timagnay yꞌishniit ifoorna. Laakiin baraah masi yꞌabakniit teen timagnaytee kaleewameen. Aree oontꞌa baraah suureeka amaagka haaliib eefeen. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Baraah usidki salal kanaab biikaayneek hayiskaab iiktiin. Oosdik ikanniit harꞌii han, bareeh attiyeewiyaat tiwasi timugaddasaatee fidnaab nakamiyaan. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Een bareeyooh dehaay tikeet tuuna een eemtaal tꞌiiteetu: Aamtaal “Uuyaas ooknaay hit eelhasi. Ukhansiir ushagwaadh uthiiniib bꞌooyamiini.” iyadna.<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Wꞌankwana itꞌigir indi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Yꞌarawaan, oon barooh malya jawaab bareekna haay asꞌakiireebu, oosdik teekwinni jillaay akantiib. Teen bateeh baabaadhiinna. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Ukwaasanaay inabiya diyaab ikatiineet tuuna iikti tindi. Inabiya imugaddasa shꞌiika allamaab ikatiineet teena baabaadhiinna. Wꞌankwanaayoonwa Wꞌishidhhiinwa waseeyaab ikatiyeet tiwasi, ilinguumaayeekna geebii soomamaat ibakii shꞌaana.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Laakiin naati hankaayka, een eembꞌi yꞌaakhareeb haay kashanaab yꞌi iyadna, baraah kasheena aree iknaayi amag niya eetriimna. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Baraah “Wꞌankwanaayuukna atꞌagiir diyaa waadiyaayaab kiiki han? Isuurkina yhankaani suur akay iiyaana, aree tuduniya han badaalt kitti.” iyadna. <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Baraah, shꞌiika tuubuutwa taabreewwa Ukwaasanaay amrii daamaat ikatiineet toona baadhneeb yhariwnayt, een ibhali iyadna. Tuubuur iyamee eeta, aree iyamee daamta. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Malya tuubuur akra kwaani yamee kwidhta. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Laakiin Ukwaasana oon amseeneet toobuutwa teebreewwa whukwimiit tooyin ookiik yhagitneet toona sooya. Malya bataah nꞌeetiib daayi iyadna, uudehay yꞌaamanaab baakay han kwidhi iyadna.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Yꞌarawaan, Wꞌankwanaay geeb gaat yin alif hawlaab tꞌiiteet tikatiyeet toona baabaadhiinna. Alif hawla aree gaat yin tꞌiiteeba. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Wꞌankwana uwaadiyaayooh hooy lalꞌaab kiiki, uudehay gali bak hiiseen. Ukwaasana aree sidik tarmuumaabu, uudehay kassaah tumaagtii tuubeetiit gaal han biikwidhayeet toona yharriiw.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Wꞌankwanaayt tooyin ugwiharaayt ajjabsi hoon tindi. Taabri win hissi geeb kwidhi iyadna, tunabꞌuuy aree tuduniya kastooh laliilsi tindi. Malya tuubuutwa kehii teefeetwa kastuuh iitlaw tindi.<verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Naatka kwidhi tindi. Aflaay baraak mugaddas kwiraay kwiriina aree Ukwaasana tireekwneet toonaati. <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />Ukwaasana oodehay kasseeh hooy hukwimiiniyeet tooyin tishabibneet toonaati. Beet tuuyin willa haay eetniyeet toona jarrabaana. Beet tooyin taabri nꞌeetii kwidhi iyadna, naatka tuuraaw han tunabꞌuuytii laliili tindi. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Laakiin Ukwaasana hinin gayiit bireetwa buutwa waadiyaaya hoon. Beentooy aree adil yhikim indi, hinin aree sidik beet toona nhagit.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Yꞌarawaan, baraakna beet toona hagitee, Wꞌankwana bareekna nhaswa, gwihaab baabariinwa, mꞌasigwa barii rhiiniyeetookna toona gwꞌadna. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Wꞌankwanaay utarmuuma midhhan ikatiyeet toona baabaadhiinna. Toon han wꞌaraawuun whayis Baawloos baliit tifagarandi Ukwaasana barooh hiiyyaab iiktiyeenaatee dehookna iktib. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Baawloos kassooh ujawaabiyooh teen teena tiknaateeb hadiidiini. Laakiin baruuh diyaab iiktiyeet teena galit wꞌafhamtiyuuh akraabi. Dehay gali yꞌagimwa wꞌiimaaniib takwakw baakaywa baruuh diyaab iiktiyeet toona haligtiit igarooyeehna kwidhseen. Baraah eektab irawi geeb han bak tꞌiiteena sakeen.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Yꞌarawaan, baraakna whankaay akraab soomamtaana. Aflaay yꞌamag dehayiit maagnaay fidnaab haay giigiit hookna umhiinookna wꞌasgaanaay bitdhibayni jillaay digwagwna. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Wꞌankwanaayoonwa Wꞌishidhhiinwa Yasuuꞌaab Umasiihiit tinꞌimaawwa tukanaantiibwa winna. Oontꞌaawwa diimaawwa umatuun bariiyooh baꞌiikti. Aamiin.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>